BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Disorder of Discourse
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261201T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261201T200000
UID:dc36efd543bbeaa922ed189b05f16d84@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/d4ab
 6b1/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1294x2000+0+0/resize/254x393!/quality/90/?u
 rl=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspo
 t%2F86%2F40%2F8282cab0498a9563869cbfa99fd6%2Ffinal-11x17-desordre-du-disco
 urs.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by https://french.indiana.edu/\nPower. Knowledge. La
 nguage. Who has the right to speak\, and how? Disorder of Discourse reimag
 ines Michel Foucault’s celebrated 1970 lecture about the power of words 
 to influence our daily lives. One of the twentieth century’s most influe
 ntial thinkers\, Foucault changed our understanding of how language and in
 stitutions shape what societies accept as truth.\nCreated by French direct
 or Fanny de Chaillé and performed by Guillaume Bailliart\, this solo perf
 ormance brings the event to life as a vivid theatrical experience. The Dec
 ember 1st show\, followed by a discussion with the audience\, is one of th
 e only two US stops of this production. Performed in French with English s
 upertitles.
LOCATION:Whittenberger Auditorium\, Indiana Memorial Union\, 900 E 7th Str
 eet\, Bloomington\, Indiana 47405
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/disorder-of-discourse-17-
 11-2026-06-58-39
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Magical Cirque Christmas
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261201T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261201T235900
UID:b6800c171336649f1d033548e17c8a3b@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/d5b9
 2dd/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x628+0+0/resize/254x133!/quality/90/?ur
 l=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fdc%2F7e%2F06c95f1b41f493
 cad3abfbe1da10%2Fmagical-cirque-social-media-formatsmagical-cirque-1200x62
 8.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by IU Auditorium\nFor more than five spectacular hol
 iday seasons\, A Magical Cirque Christmas has captivated fans and welcomed
  families\, making it part of their seasonal celebrations.\n Overflowing w
 ith festive charm and dazzling cirque artistry\, A Magical Cirque Christma
 s showcases the extraordinary talents of world-class performers through gr
 avity-defying acrobatics\, awe-inspiring displays of strength and agility
 \, laugh-out-loud comedy\, and heartwarming magic. Set to a lively soundtr
 ack of modern holiday hits\, each act delivers a fresh and unforgettable C
 hristmastime experience.\n Beloved by audiences of all ages\, A Magical Ci
 rque Christmas is a joyful way to celebrate the season together.\nTickets:
  https://www.iuauditorium.com/events/detail/a-magical-cirque-christmas-202
 6
LOCATION:IU Auditorium\, 1211 East 7th Street\, Bloomington\, Indiana 4740
 5
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/a-magical-cirque-christma
 s-05-08-2026-12-53-52
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
