SUMMARY:Winter at the Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261210T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261210T193000
UID:b3acd7e045ac093a1fe0e1ed2cd0cd00@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/3ac0
 4ba/2147483647/strip/true/crop/792x451+0+0/resize/254x145!/quality/90/?url
 =https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%
 2F94%2Fad%2F4b8efbc6406aac2c1d9702d31076%2Findiana-public-media-events-win
 ter.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by IU Museum of Archaeology & Anthropology\nGet out 
 of the cold and cozy up for a night of winter wonder! Join the IUMAA for W
 inter at the Museum\, a festive evening filled with a flurry of creativity
  and imagination.\n Decorate a wreath or dreidel while surrounded by delic
 ate harp melodies.\nThinking of loved ones far away? Decorate your own hol
 iday card to send their way!\nWant to add some flair to your own home fest
 ivities? Make some beaded garlands and decorate your own ornaments.\nDon
 ’t forget to enjoy some hot chocolate and holiday pastries!
LOCATION:IU Museum of Archaeology and Anthropology\, 416 N Indiana Ave\, B
 loomington\, Indiana 47408
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/winter-at-the-museum-16-1
 1-2026-10-21-35
