DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261211T170000
UID:89e1398485e17aa8760b84b1f5be6cf8@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/f0cc
 377/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1080x1080+0+0/resize/254x254!/quality/90/?u
 rl=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F85%2F7f%2Fa6ff60844727a
 124baaad34a57c2%2F2026tgt-web.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Bedford Public Library\nThe Giving Tree is coming
  back to Bedford Public Library on November 9th - December 11th! This year
  we are accepting donations of new hats\, gloves/mittens\, scarves\, and s
 ocks. All the donations will be given out in our community through places 
 like SPIN\, Becky's Place\, Hoosier Uplands\, CORE Nursing Home\, and Agap
 e House. Donations of all sizes are always welcome and needed. You can dro
 p off your donations by the Circulation Desk!
LOCATION:Bedford Public Library\, 1323 K Street\, Bedford\, Indiana 47421
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/the-giving-tree-03-11-202
 6-12-25-27
