BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Miracle on 34th Street (1947)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T235900
UID:8adb07cfa16c383d1f3f943ca64892a9@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/cf9e
 799/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1920x1080+0+0/resize/254x143!/quality/90/?u
 rl=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F70%2F8b%2Fda4f670741c19
 3bde0152cb532d2%2Fmiracleon34th.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Buskirk-Chumley Theater\nIn this Christmas classi
 c\, an old man going by the name of Kris Kringle (Edmund Gwenn) fills in f
 or an intoxicated Santa in Macy’s annual Thanksgiving Day parade. Kringl
 e proves to be such a hit that he is soon appearing regularly at the chain
 ’s main store in midtown Manhattan. When Kringle surprises customers and
  employees alike by claiming that he really is Santa Claus\, it leads to a
  court case to determine his mental health and\, more importantly\, his au
 thenticity.\n Miracle on 34th Street won three Academy Awards and in 2005
 \, the film was selected for preservation in the United States National Fi
 lm Registry by the Library of Congress as being “culturally\, historical
 ly or aesthetically significant.”\n Rated: For Everyone\nLength: 1hr 41m
 ins\nFormat: DCP\nTickets: https://buskirkchumley.org/events/miracle-on-34
 th-street-1947-december-20-2026/
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington\, Indi
 ana 47408
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/miracle-on-34th-street-19
 47-29-10-2026-15-02-46
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Straight No Chaser
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T230000
UID:15673517453d67d41351a02ef9a2b3ad@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/d275
 49a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1920x900+0+0/resize/254x119!/quality/90/?ur
 l=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa8%2Fb3%2Fcebeca7b47e5b1
 62d1247c9852db%2Fsnc-hero-3840x1800.png
DESCRIPTION:The holiday season is not complete without the return of a cap
 pella sensations Straight No Chaser—born right here at Indiana Universit
 y. The group has become synonymous with the sound of the holidays\, delive
 ring crowd-pleasing arrangements with humor\, heart\, and flawless harmoni
 es. This year’s performance will be part of their all-new nationwide “
 Making Spirits Bright” tour. Join WTIU as a sustaining member at $20 a m
 onth and request two tickets to your choice of performances: Thursday\, De
 cember 10th at 7:30pm at the IU Auditorium in Bloomington\, or Sunday\, De
 cember 20th at 3pm at the Murat Theatre in Indianapolis.\nTickets: https:/
 /indianapublicmedia.secureallegiance.com/wtiu/WebModule/Donate.aspx?P=WTIU
 EVENT&PAGETYPE=PLG&CHECK=%2bMwnEwJL%2fJmir9ChIHHAmK1gzMC6uhq5nDjkJobrCdg%3
 d
LOCATION:Old National Centre\, 502 N New Jersey St\, Indianapolis\, Indian
 a 46204
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/straight-no-chaser-20-08-
 2026-08-54-56
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
