BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Wiz
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270127T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270127T235900
UID:145e7c1dad4151c845bfaadec46a370e@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/4369
 e2c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1080x1080+0+0/resize/254x254!/quality/90/?u
 rl=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F24%2Fa7%2F76ff6e4a434d9
 422acb2aa944b3c%2Fwiz-1080x1080.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by IU Auditorium\nThe Tony Award-winning Best Musica
 l that took the world by storm is back.\n The Wiz returns “home” to st
 ages across America in an all-new tour\, direct from Broadway.\n The Balti
 more Sun raves “Powerhouse performances. Stunning choreography. Visionar
 y sets\,” and the Chicago Sun-Times proclaims The Wiz is “an eye-poppi
 ng and high-intensity revival!”\n This groundbreaking twist on The Wizar
 d of Oz changed the face of Broadway—from its iconic score packed with s
 oul\, gospel\, rock\, and 70s funk to its stirring tale of Dorothy’s jou
 rney to find her place in a contemporary world.\n Everybody rejoice—this
  dynamite infusion of ballet\, jazz\, and modern pop brings a whole new gr
 oove to easing on down the road!\nTickets: https://www.iuauditorium.com/ev
 ents/detail/thewiz-2027
LOCATION:IU Auditorium\, 1211 East 7th Street\, Bloomington\, Indiana 4740
 5
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/the-wiz-05-08-2026-12-58-
 49
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
