UID:8cfd69b94105792819dc8bdbdc9cc8fe@ipm.org
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Go Big Productions\nJoin us for a night of laught
 er as we explore everything from motherhood\, midlife crisis\, marriage\, 
 divorce\, online dating\, and other things that irritate us. Men are welco
 me to the show\, too.\n Moms Unhinged has been selling out shows all over 
 the country and is coming BACK to Bloomington with a BRAND NEW lineup of m
 om comedians. New faces\, same great laughs!\n We do clean (ish) comedy an
 d this is a fun night out with your girlfriends\, drinking club (I mean bo
 ok club)\, neighborhood group or your own mom. Laughter is proven to lower
  your cortisol!\n Performing: Andrea Marie\, Avril Granato\, and special h
 eadliner Nancy Norton.\n Adult Language. 18+\nTickets: https://buskirkchum
 ley.org/events/moms-unhinged-standup-comedy-show-february-1-2027/
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington\, Indi
 ana 47408
