 cfd2633c432d232%2Fjoe-bonamassa-scaled.jpg
DESCRIPTION:As the legendary blues rock performer who has played over 3000
  shows across the country and earned multiple Grammy nominations\, Bonamas
 sa continues to push the limits of the blues rock genre. Join WTIU with a 
 monthly donation of $20 and we will send you two tickets to the show on Mo
 nday\, February 15th at 8pm at the historic Murat Theatre in downtown Indi
 anapolis. Up that monthly sustaining support to $25 and enjoy the ultimate
  Bonamassa fan experience! Not only will we send you two tickets to the sh
 ow\, but we will also include two passes to a sound check experience befor
 e the show. Get a behind-the-scenes look at the tour\, hear Joe and the ba
 nd rehearse for the night's show\, and receive an autographed photo!\nTick
 ets: https://indianapublicmedia.secureallegiance.com/wtiu/WebModule/Donate
 .aspx?P=WTIUEVENT&PAGETYPE=PLG&CHECK=%2bMwnEwJL%2fJmir9ChIHHAmK1gzMC6uhq5n
 DjkJobrCdg%3d
LOCATION:Old National Centre\, 502 N New Jersey St\, Indianapolis\, Indian
 a 46204
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/joe-bonamassa-20-08-2026-
 08-56-55
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
